  <main>
    <h1>Send your Substack to&nbsp;the&nbsp;printers.</h1>
    <div class="rule-orn"><span>&#10086;</span></div>
    <p class="lede">Paste your Substack URL. Inksheaf turns the last year of public writing
    into a classic 6×9 edition under your own masthead, divided into the volumes it needs:
    one book, a quarterly set, a monthly magazine. The math is done before you decide
