        white to cut the print cost. Measured on Lulu&rsquo;s print API: a 200-page volume prints
        for $6.99 in black and white, $10.83 in colour</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Live example</td><td>The first edition is on sale now at its exact $9.34 print
